msgid ""
"The Moon's sign, degree and house from a birth chart. Answers \"what is my "
"moon sign\" on its own, without the whole chart around it."
msgstr ""
"Tanda, derajat, dan rumah Bulan dari bagan kelahiran. Menjawab \"what is my "
"moon sign\" secara mandiri, tanpa seluruh bagan di sekitarnya."

#: includes/views/admin-shortcodes.php:116
msgid ""
"WGS-84 latitude. Only affects the house shown; the sign is the same "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Lintang WGS-84. Hanya memengaruhi rumah yang ditampilkan; tanda tetap sama "
"di mana saja."

